    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0201" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg141"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September 20,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Opposition of China to commission practically finished. Commission will go unless
                    you countermand.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
